T*
(Start the backend from backend:) Tj T*
T*
(powershell) Tj T*
(.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000 --reload) Tj T*
T*
T*
(The important detail is app.main:app. The old main:app path is no longer correct because the FastAPI) Tj T*
(file is inside backend/app.) Tj T*
T*
(Start the frontend from frontend:) Tj T*
T*
(powershell) Tj T*
(npm.cmd run dev) Tj T*
T*
T*
(The normal URLs are:) Tj T*
T*
(text) Tj T*
(Frontend: http://localhost:5173) Tj T*
(Backend:  http://127.0.0.1:8000) Tj T*
(Health:   http://127.0.0.1:8000/health) Tj T*
T*
T*
(4. Configuration) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/config.py loads backend/.env, validates required settings, and exposes constants used by the) Tj T*
(rest of the backend. The important settings are:) Tj T*
T*
(| Setting | Purpose |) Tj T*
(|---|---|) Tj T*
(| GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT | Google Cloud project used by Gemini, BigQuery, and storage |) Tj T*
(| BQ_DATASET | BigQuery dataset, currently manufacturing_rag |) Tj T*
(| BQ_LOCATION | BigQuery job location |) Tj T*
(| EMBEDDING_MODEL | Query/document embedding model, currently gemini-embedding-001 |) Tj T*
(| EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS | Shared vector size, currently 768 |) Tj T*
(| GCS_BUCKET_NAME | Cloud Storage bucket containing manual assets |) Tj T*
(| REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS | Maximum time for one chat request |) Tj T*
(| FRONTEND_ORIGIN | Allowed browser origin for CORS |) Tj T*
T*
(There is deliberately no active single-machine setting. Retrieval reads machine_name from BigQuery, so) Tj T*
(HSG-2550, HAB-3232, and future machines can coexist.) Tj T*
T*
(5. Complete request flow) Tj T*
T*
(text) Tj T*
(User types question) Tj T*
(        ?) Tj T*
ET
