(6. HTTP API files) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/main.py) Tj T*
T*
(Creates the FastAPI application, configures CORS, runs startup checks, and includes the four routers. It) Tj T*
(is the ASGI entry point used by Uvicorn.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/api/chat_routes.py) Tj T*
