T*
(8. Retrieval and BigQuery) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/retrieval/embeddings.py) Tj T*
T*
(Creates a cached Vertex AI client and calls gemini-embedding-001 with task type RETRIEVAL_QUERY. The) Tj T*
(output must contain exactly 768 numbers. A different vector length raises an error because cosine) Tj T*
(distance requires equal-length vectors.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/retrieval/bigquery_client.py) Tj T*
T*
(Creates a cached BigQuery client, binds query parameters, limits billed bytes, waits for the query, and) Tj T*
(converts BigQuery rows into normal Python dictionaries. It caches the client connection, not query) Tj T*
(results.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/retrieval/manual_search.py) Tj T*
T*
(This is the core retriever.) Tj T*
T*
(1. It embeds the user question.) Tj T*
(2. It extracts up to 12 simple keyword terms.) Tj T*
(3. It searches only document_chunks for the initial candidates.) Tj T*
(4. It compares the question vector with stored vectors using ML.DISTANCE\(..., 'COSINE'\).) Tj T*
(5. It adds a small keyword bonus to the distance score.) Tj T*
(6. It keeps the best 10 semantic seed chunks, plus limited media candidates when requested.) Tj T*
(7. It expands the selected chunks to the same document/page.) Tj T*
(8. It enriches those selected pages from geometry, images, table rows, links, relationships, and) Tj T*
(sections.) Tj T*
(9. It selects up to 24 text chunks, up to 6 image rows, and up to 8 link rows within the response budget.) Tj T*
(10. It loads saved QR links for each machine represented in the selected chunks.) Tj T*
T*
(The initial retrieval source is always document_chunks. Other tables add context only after a chunk has) Tj T*
(been selected.) Tj T*
T*
(The current vector constraints are intentional:) Tj T*
T*
(text) Tj T*
(embedding_model       gemini-embedding-001) Tj T*
(embedding_dimensions  768) Tj T*
T*
T*
(Adding more manuals increases the number of rows, not the vector dimension. If a document has another) Tj T*
(dimension, it must be re-embedded to 768 before loading.) Tj T*
T*
(list_available_documents\(\)) Tj T*
T*
(This function runs a simple grouped query over document_chunks:) Tj T*
T*
(sql) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
