T*
T*
(It is used for inventory questions and is why the agent can list all machines instead of returning only) Tj T*
(the nearest HSG chunks.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/retrieval/qr_link_search.py) Tj T*
T*
(Reads verified QR destinations saved in the QR links table. It filters by machine, document, and page so) Tj T*
(unrelated QR links are not shown.) Tj T*
T*
(9. Media and evidence) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/media/prepare_media.py) Tj T*
T*
(Takes retrieved chunks and prepares the media payload for the agent. It ensures every supplied) Tj T*
(image/link retains its source chunk and records warnings instead of silently losing an asset.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/media/manual_images.py) Tj T*
T*
(Loads images from Cloud Storage, renders PDF pages when needed, normalizes uploaded images, and uses) Tj T*
(bounded caches for repeated assets. It never allows arbitrary user paths.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/media/video_links.py) Tj T*
T*
(Validates URLs and identifies approved manual video targets. Links from unrelated pages are excluded.) Tj T*
(YouTube links are normalized for frontend playback.) Tj T*
T*
(10. Structured response files) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/responses/schemas.py) Tj T*
T*
(Defines Pydantic models such as AgentAnswer, AnswerBlock, and ImageDescription. These schemas force the) Tj T*
(model to return predictable JSON.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/responses/response_builder.py) Tj T*
T*
(Validates evidence IDs, rejects unsupported or invented evidence, preserves all relevant selected media,) Tj T*
(and converts the model answer into frontend blocks. Image blocks include a description, and source) Tj T*
(blocks identify the manual, page, and chunk.) Tj T*
T*
(11. Sessions) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/sessions/session_store.py) Tj T*
T*
(Uses the ADK in-memory session service. A session stores recent messages and workflow state such as the) Tj T*
(main topic, guided troubleshooting step, and completion status. Sessions expire after the configured) Tj T*
(TTL, currently up to one hour. Restarting the backend clears in-memory sessions.) Tj T*
ET
