(npm.cmd run build) Tj T*
T*
T*
(16. What is currently implemented) Tj T*
T*
(- Multiple machine manuals in one document_chunks table.) Tj T*
(- Machine-independent retrieval.) Tj T*
(- 768-dimensional Gemini embeddings.) Tj T*
(- Semantic cosine search plus keyword scoring.) Tj T*
(- Top semantic seeds followed by same-page context expansion.) Tj T*
(- Text, table, image, PDF-page, video, and QR-link support.) Tj T*
(- Image descriptions in the final answer.) Tj T*
(- Evidence validation that rejects unknown or invented citations.) Tj T*
(- Session history and guided troubleshooting state.) Tj T*
(- CORS, upload validation, bounded timeouts, and service error responses.) Tj T*
(- Offline Document AI QR extraction and verified QR-link storage.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
